“ ”
“Um, I just don’t want that awful, sword-obsessed idiot to leave me
behind.”

249

Saying it out loud, this motivation sounded so ridiculous that Grimm
found he could almost laugh at himself. Wilhelm walked his own
path, an intense and lonely road on which no one could approach
him. That was the wellspring that fed his strength and made him who
