259

impossibly audacious behavior. They had hardly gotten home before
Carol started griping, and Grimm smiled without quite meaning to.
“Grimm? What exactly is so funny? Did I say something amusing?”
Not funny. More like...predictable, maybe.
“Hmph. You mean you knew I would get angry?”
You tell me, teacher.
He scribbled quickly on a pad of paper he produced from his bag,
teasing her.
